{"2810190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nanuka: Secret of the Shattering Moon", "steam_appid": 2810190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clumsy purple belt saves the world?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanuka finds herself thrown into the midst of a giant impending disaster! Play as a martial artist in this hand-drawn action platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810190/extras/85472e98317fe993f958004a4771f947.avif?t=1761664275\" width=1560 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat 'em up with style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter formidable foes and bosses, fight through waves of enemies and uncover the evil mastermind's plan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810190/extras/40a8d732312f82387a485c17d3a740ce.avif?t=1761664275\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810190/extras_big/40a8d732312f82387a485c17d3a740ce.webp?t=1761664275 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain abilities through allies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather allies throughout the story to unlock new skills and abilities! Use and combine their powers to blast through the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810190/extras/d071fa083c623b2728a90e6cf76d5d7e.avif?t=1761664275\" width=1560 height=419 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you rise to the challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret of the shattering moon together with Nanuka and her allies as you pl